    "kind": "weapon",
    "slug": "weapon:temperbrand",
    "name": "Temperbrand",
    "level": 20,
    "rarity": "unique",
    "traits": ["fire", "magical", "shove"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "prey-for-death"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "When the mighty fire-and-metal elemental "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Temperbrand",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is defeated, their corpse transforms into a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "+3 major striking greater flaming grievous shifting maul",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " made of what appears to be molten steel, though it behaves as if it were made of solid metal. When a creature first picks up "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Temperbrand",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", they must succeed at a "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "save:will",
            "dc": 43
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " save to establish their dominance over the weapon. On a success, they become "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Temperbrand's",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " only accepted wielder and may use the weapon normally. On a failure, the character takes "
          },
          {
            "type": "damage",
            "instances": [
              {
                "formula": "20d6",
                "damageType": "fire"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " damage ("
          },
          {
            "type": "damage",
            "instances": [
              {
                "formula": "40d6",
                "damageType": "fire"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " damage on a critical failure) and drops the weapon as it melts away into slag and immediately reforms in an adjacent space. A new attempt to establish dominance can be made by picking the weapon up again and attempting a new Will save. Once "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Temperbrand",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " has an accepted wielder, it can't be wielded by anyone else unless the accepted wielder intentionally permits it, declaring so in a loud voice; this permission can be rescinded in a similar manner. Anyone else trying to wield "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Temperbrand",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " after it has accepted a wielder takes fire damage and causes the weapon to melt away as if they failed the Will save to wield it."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The additional fire damage caused by "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Temperbrand's",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " greater flaming property (but not its persistent fire damage) is splash damage. "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Temperbrand's",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " wielder is immune to this splash damage."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate—Molten Smash",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "type": "action-cost",
            "cost": "one"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
